 334:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   * @brief By default in multiprocessor mode, when the wake up method is set
 335:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *        to address mark, the UART handles only 4-bit long addresses detection;
 336:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *        this API allows to enable longer addresses detection (6-, 7- or 8-bit
